{"module":"/assets/explain/knowledge/abstract-monotonicity.js","part":"figure","scope":"abstract-monotonicity","title":"任取两点：代入的输入落在哪里","note":"拖动 $x_1$、$x_2$（或用滑块）。加法型代入 $t=x_2-x_1$，乘法型代入 $t=\\dfrac{x_2}{x_1}$；只有 $t$ 落在符号条件管的范围里，才能判断 $f(x_2)-f(x_1)$ 的正负。图中不画 $f$ 的图像，因为题目没有给出解析式。","stylesheet":"/assets/explain/knowledge/abstract-monotonicity.css","version":"baeb998037a8","html":"<div class=\"am-explorer\" data-am-family=\"additive\">\n  <div class=\"am-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"函数关系的类型\">\n    <button type=\"button\" data-am-case=\"additive\" aria-pressed=\"true\">加法型<small>f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y)</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-am-case=\"multiplicative\" aria-pressed=\"false\">乘法型<small>f(xy)=f(x)+f(y)</small></button>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"am-given\" data-am-given>已知 f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y)，x>0 时 f(x)>0</p>\n  <div data-am-figure><svg class=\"am-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 196\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"am-graph-title\">\n    <title id=\"am-graph-title\">任取两点后，代入的输入是否落在符号条件的范围内</title>\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"344\" height=\"180\" rx=\"8\" class=\"am-plot\"/>\n    <text x=\"20\" y=\"30\" class=\"am-caption\">任取两点</text>\n\n    <path d=\"M32 58H328\" class=\"am-axis\"/>\n    <path d=\"M332 58L322 53V63Z\" class=\"am-axis-arrow\"/>\n    <text x=\"336\" y=\"62\" class=\"am-name\">x</text>\n    <path d=\"M40 54V62\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">−3</text><path d=\"M86.66666666666666 54V62\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"86.66666666666666\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">−2</text><path d=\"M133.33333333333331 54V62\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"133.33333333333331\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">−1</text><path d=\"M180 54V62\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">0</text><path d=\"M226.66666666666666 54V62\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"226.66666666666666\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">1</text><path d=\"M273.33333333333337 54V62\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"273.33333333333337\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">2</text><path d=\"M320 54V62\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">3</text>\n    <path data-am-gap d=\"M133.33333333333331 58H250\" data-tone=\"ok\" class=\"am-gap\"/>\n    <circle data-am-point=\"0\" r=\"8\" cx=\"133.33333333333331\" cy=\"58\" class=\"am-dot am-dot-1\"/>\n    <circle data-am-point=\"1\" r=\"8\" cx=\"250\" cy=\"58\" class=\"am-dot am-dot-2\"/>\n    <text data-am-label=\"0\" x=\"133.33333333333331\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-point-label\">x₁=−1</text>\n    <text data-am-label=\"1\" x=\"250\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-point-label\">x₂=1.5</text>\n    <text x=\"20\" y=\"114\" class=\"am-caption\">代入的输入 t=x₂−x₁</text>\n    <rect x=\"180\" y=\"124\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" class=\"am-band\"/>\n    <text x=\"316\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"am-band-label\">符号条件管的范围 t>0</text>\n    <path d=\"M32 138H328\" class=\"am-axis\"/>\n    <path d=\"M332 138L322 133V143Z\" class=\"am-axis-arrow\"/>\n    <text x=\"336\" y=\"142\" class=\"am-name\">t</text>\n    <path d=\"M40 134V142\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">−6</text><path d=\"M86.66666666666666 134V142\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"86.66666666666666\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">−4</text><path d=\"M133.33333333333331 134V142\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"133.33333333333331\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">−2</text><path d=\"M180 134V142\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">0</text><path d=\"M226.66666666666666 134V142\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"226.66666666666666\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">2</text><path d=\"M273.33333333333337 134V142\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"273.33333333333337\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">4</text><path d=\"M320 134V142\" class=\"am-axis\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"am-tick\">6</text>\n    <circle data-am-key r=\"7\" cx=\"238.33333333333334\" cy=\"138\" data-tone=\"ok\" class=\"am-key\"/>\n  </svg></div>\n  <div class=\"am-sliders\">\n    <label>x₁ <input type=\"range\" data-am-slider=\"0\" min=\"-3\" max=\"3\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"-1\"></label>\n    <label>x₂ <input type=\"range\" data-am-slider=\"1\" min=\"-3\" max=\"3\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.5\"></label>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"am-status\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-am-status data-tone=\"ok\">x₂−x₁=2.5，落在 t>0 里。由 f(x₂)=f(x₁)+f(x₂−x₁)，得 f(x₂)−f(x₁)=f(x₂−x₁)>0，所以 f(x₁)<f(x₂)。</p>\n</div>"}
